<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link><description>India News Today: Get latest India news and breaking news from India on Times of India. TOI brings the top news headlines from India on Politics, Elections, Current Affairs and more</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-09-30T22:01:22+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/-2128936835.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Wed, 30 Sep 2026 22:01:22 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>India News | Latest India News Today &amp; Real-time News from India, India Breaking News</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Protests against SIR, CEC: Is it time for Congress and INDIA bloc to take a leaf out of CJP's playbook?]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/protests-against-sir-cec-is-it-time-for-congress-and-india-bloc-to-take-a-leaf-out-of-cjps-playbook/articleshow/134597912.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134597912.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The INDIA bloc, under Congress's leadership, is gearing up for a vigorous campaign against electoral misconduct and the Election Commission's authority. Their strategy includes widespread protests and a pivotal 'Save Democracy March' to elevate public consciousness while pressuring for essential reforms. Additionally, the bloc intends to approach the Supreme Court about ongoing electoral challenges. Among their key proposals are reinstating ballot voting and refining voter registration methods.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/protests-against-sir-cec-is-it-time-for-congress-and-india-bloc-to-take-a-leaf-out-of-cjps-playbook/articleshow/134597912.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/protests-against-sir-cec-is-it-time-for-congress-and-india-bloc-to-take-a-leaf-out-of-cjps-playbook/articleshow/134597912.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T21:34:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kunal Varma</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134598750,imgsize-120940.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Certificate not needed’: JD(U)’s sharp reply to Sonia Gandhi on Nitish]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/certificate-not-needed-jdus-sharp-reply-to-sonia-gandhi-on-nitish/articleshow/134598160.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134598160.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/certificate-not-needed-jdus-sharp-reply-to-sonia-gandhi-on-nitish/articleshow/134598160.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/certificate-not-needed-jdus-sharp-reply-to-sonia-gandhi-on-nitish/articleshow/134598160.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T21:19:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134598203,imgsize-757977.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Unacceptable': Assam CM issues apology after his convoy halts ambulance in Silchar]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/unacceptable-assam-cm-issues-apology-after-his-convoy-halts-ambulance-in-silchar/articleshow/134598116.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134598116.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/unacceptable-assam-cm-issues-apology-after-his-convoy-halts-ambulance-in-silchar/articleshow/134598116.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/unacceptable-assam-cm-issues-apology-after-his-convoy-halts-ambulance-in-silchar/articleshow/134598116.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T21:14:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134598148,imgsize-576548.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Flydubai flight drama: How Indian pilot Smit Machchhar stopped Omani co-pilot from crashing plane]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/flydubai-flight-drama-how-indian-pilot-smit-machchhar-stopped-omani-co-pilot-from-crashing-plane/articleshow/134597514.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134597514.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/flydubai-flight-drama-how-indian-pilot-smit-machchhar-stopped-omani-co-pilot-from-crashing-plane/articleshow/134597514.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/flydubai-flight-drama-how-indian-pilot-smit-machchhar-stopped-omani-co-pilot-from-crashing-plane/articleshow/134597514.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T21:11:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134598069,imgsize-66000.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Operation Sheruwali: How security forces tracked LeT commander Musa in months-long hunt since May]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/operation-sheruwali-how-security-forces-tracked-let-commander-musa-in-months-long-hunt-since-may/articleshow/134595813.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134595813.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/operation-sheruwali-how-security-forces-tracked-let-commander-musa-in-months-long-hunt-since-may/articleshow/134595813.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/operation-sheruwali-how-security-forces-tracked-let-commander-musa-in-months-long-hunt-since-may/articleshow/134595813.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T20:42:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134597650,imgsize-99301.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['No ban but also not 24x7': SC on firecrackers in Delhi-NCR ahead of Diwali]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-ban-but-also-not-24x7-sc-on-firecrackers-in-delhi-ncr-ahead-of-diwali/articleshow/134596895.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134596895.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Supreme Court has ruled out an outright ban on firecrackers in Delhi-NCR, aiming instead for a compromise between health and cultural practices. Fireworks will only be allowed during specific times, with an emphasis on using environmentally friendly options that satisfy rigorous safety standards by licensed producers. The matter regarding barium in firecrackers will be further examined on October 15.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-ban-but-also-not-24x7-sc-on-firecrackers-in-delhi-ncr-ahead-of-diwali/articleshow/134596895.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-ban-but-also-not-24x7-sc-on-firecrackers-in-delhi-ncr-ahead-of-diwali/articleshow/134596895.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T20:16:23+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134597261,imgsize-124698.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Dangerous path’: MEA urges Indians to stay away from Russian military recruitment]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dangerous-path-mea-urges-indians-to-stay-away-from-russian-military-recruitment/articleshow/134596800.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134596800.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The ministry of external affairs has issued a warning about the risks of joining the Russian armed forces. It stated that many Indians are being recruited under false promises of financial benefits. The advisory emphasized that this path could expose individuals to significant dangers. Continuous engagement with Russia is ongoing to ensure the safety of affected Indian nationals. Citizens are urged to verify job offers and avoid unregistered agents.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dangerous-path-mea-urges-indians-to-stay-away-from-russian-military-recruitment/articleshow/134596800.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dangerous-path-mea-urges-indians-to-stay-away-from-russian-military-recruitment/articleshow/134596800.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T19:49:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134596862,imgsize-123072.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[India's monsoon rainfall ends 13% below normal, fourth-lowest since 2001]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indias-monsoon-rainfall-ends-13-below-normal-fourth-lowest-since-2001/articleshow/134596710.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134596710.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[India recorded 87.4 percent of its long period average rainfall during this year's southwest monsoon. The country received 759.4 mm of rain, which is 13 percent below normal. El Niño significantly contributed to the below-average rainfall, especially noted in southern and western regions. Despite a late surge in rainfall, several areas faced substantial deficits, particularly Punjab and South India. The overall monsoon season ended as the driest since 2015.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indias-monsoon-rainfall-ends-13-below-normal-fourth-lowest-since-2001/articleshow/134596710.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indias-monsoon-rainfall-ends-13-below-normal-fourth-lowest-since-2001/articleshow/134596710.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T19:43:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134596782,imgsize-55562.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A tap on the table, a pat on the back: The Sonia-Mamata moment that stood out at INDIA bloc meet]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/a-tap-on-the-table-a-pat-on-the-back-the-sonia-mamata-moment-that-stood-out-at-india-bloc-meet/articleshow/134596071.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134596071.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The INDIA bloc meeting focused on alleged electoral irregularities and the opposition’s protest plan, but a warm exchange between Sonia Gandhi and Mamata Banerjee drew attention.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/a-tap-on-the-table-a-pat-on-the-back-the-sonia-mamata-moment-that-stood-out-at-india-bloc-meet/articleshow/134596071.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/a-tap-on-the-table-a-pat-on-the-back-the-sonia-mamata-moment-that-stood-out-at-india-bloc-meet/articleshow/134596071.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T19:37:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Priyanka Mukherjee</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134596442,imgsize-1344980.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Had productive conversation': PM Modi speaks with US President Trump on trade, defence, energy]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/had-productive-conversation-pm-modi-speaks-with-us-president-trump-on-trade-defence-energy/articleshow/134596156.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134596156.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/had-productive-conversation-pm-modi-speaks-with-us-president-trump-on-trade-defence-energy/articleshow/134596156.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/had-productive-conversation-pm-modi-speaks-with-us-president-trump-on-trade-defence-energy/articleshow/134596156.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T19:20:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134596159,imgsize-94522.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[India's consul general meets Shanghai mayor, extends wishes ahead of China’s National Day]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indias-consul-general-meets-shanghai-mayor-extends-wishes-ahead-of-chinas-national-day/articleshow/134595569.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134595569.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indias-consul-general-meets-shanghai-mayor-extends-wishes-ahead-of-chinas-national-day/articleshow/134595569.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/indias-consul-general-meets-shanghai-mayor-extends-wishes-ahead-of-chinas-national-day/articleshow/134595569.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T18:53:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134595653,imgsize-1010004.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['This nonsense has to stop': SC pulls up UP Police over unnamed FIRs, suggests CBI probe in all cases]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/this-nonsense-has-to-stop-sc-pulls-up-up-police-over-unnamed-fir-suggests-cbi-probe-in-all-cases/articleshow/134594779.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134594779.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/this-nonsense-has-to-stop-sc-pulls-up-up-police-over-unnamed-fir-suggests-cbi-probe-in-all-cases/articleshow/134594779.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/this-nonsense-has-to-stop-sc-pulls-up-up-police-over-unnamed-fir-suggests-cbi-probe-in-all-cases/articleshow/134594779.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T18:51:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134595096,imgsize-87390.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Evening news wrap: Flydubai pilot stabbed mid-air, man behind Pahalgam attack killed &amp; more]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-flydubai-pilot-stabbed-mid-air-man-behind-pahalgam-attack-killed-more/articleshow/134594929.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134594929.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Flydubai flight FDB1073 from Dubai to Tel Aviv made an emergency landing in Saudi Arabia after a stabbing incident. Passengers reported a pilot being attacked, leading to a sudden mid-air descent of the Boeing 737 MAX. Meanwhile, the BJP accused the INDIA bloc of protesting against the Election Commission to preempt election losses. Additionally, Hashim Moosa, a terrorist wanted for a prior attack, was killed in a J&amp;K encounter.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-flydubai-pilot-stabbed-mid-air-man-behind-pahalgam-attack-killed-more/articleshow/134594929.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-flydubai-pilot-stabbed-mid-air-man-behind-pahalgam-attack-killed-more/articleshow/134594929.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T18:37:42+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134595191,imgsize-1157387.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Upanishads to Mahabharata: NCERT explains roots of national, SC mottos]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/upanishads-to-mahabharata-ncert-explains-roots-of-national-sc-mottos/articleshow/134594774.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134594774.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The NCERT has introduced a groundbreaking Class IX social science textbook that bridges modern principles of governance with ancient Indian wisdom. By drawing connections between India's national motto, values upheld by the Supreme Court, and revered texts like the Mahabharata, this textbook advocates for key governance themes such as accountability, inclusiveness, and transparency. These concepts underline the need for various societal roles in fostering public welfare and ensuring democracy thrives.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/upanishads-to-mahabharata-ncert-explains-roots-of-national-sc-mottos/articleshow/134594774.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/upanishads-to-mahabharata-ncert-explains-roots-of-national-sc-mottos/articleshow/134594774.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T18:23:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Manash Pratim Gohain</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134594947,imgsize-119220.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Blue drum case: Meerut court convicts wife, lover for husband’s murder]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/blue-drum-case-meerut-court-convicts-wife-lover-for-husbands-murder/articleshow/134594081.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134594081.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/blue-drum-case-meerut-court-convicts-wife-lover-for-husbands-murder/articleshow/134594081.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/blue-drum-case-meerut-court-convicts-wife-lover-for-husbands-murder/articleshow/134594081.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T17:49:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134594088,imgsize-62452.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Many are in contact’: Akhilesh claims BJP alliance MLAs in touch with SP ahead of Rajya Sabha polls]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/many-are-in-contact-akhilesh-claims-bjp-alliance-mlas-in-touch-with-sp-ahead-of-rajya-sabha-polls/articleshow/134593117.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134593117.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Akhilesh Yadav announced that several BJP MLAs are in contact with the Samajwadi Party for Rajya Sabha elections. He emphasized that the SP would maintain an alliance based on winnability for upcoming assembly polls. Yadav defended the nomination of industrialist Dhanraj Parimal Nathwani, stating the SP seeks to connect with the industrial sector. He assured pending payments for sugarcane growers would be made quickly if the SP forms the government.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/many-are-in-contact-akhilesh-claims-bjp-alliance-mlas-in-touch-with-sp-ahead-of-rajya-sabha-polls/articleshow/134593117.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/many-are-in-contact-akhilesh-claims-bjp-alliance-mlas-in-touch-with-sp-ahead-of-rajya-sabha-polls/articleshow/134593117.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-30T17:39:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134593915,imgsize-64806.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[INDIA bloc meet: BJP says Oct 2 march is to ‘save dynasty, not democracy']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-meet-bjp-says-oct-2-